\begin{enumerate}
\item If $X$ has the Schur-concave property for $p$, then so does $Y=\sum_i\alpha_iX_i$;\\

\item If $X$ has the Schur-convex property for $p$, then so does $Y=\sum_i\alpha_iX_i$.
