body:
[Lemma Lema1 of arXiv:2609.03909, 'Conic Pseudo-Finslerian Mechanical Systems'] An admissible curve $\gamma : I \subset \mathbb R \to M$ is a positive reparameterized geodesic of a conic pseudo-Finslerian metric $L$ if and only if it satisfies 
     \begin{equation*}
D^{\gamma'}_{\gamma}\gamma'=h(t)\gamma'(t),
     \end{equation*}
for some differentiable function $h:I\to \mathbb R$.

