[Lemma 54 of arXiv:2608.27307, '2608.27307'] Under the assumptions of Theorem~\ref{thm:rand_sc_eq}, let $B_1,B_2,B_3\in\C^{L\times L}$ be deterministic matrices of bounded norm. Uniformly for $z$ satisfying \eqref{eq:rand_err_dom},
        \begin{align}
                \frac1N\abs{\avg{B_1G\wt IGB_2}_{L}}                                                      & \prec \frac{\vphi+\eta}{N\eta},                                                 \\
                \frac1{N^2}\sum_{i,\mu} \abs{(B_1G\wh\Sg^{1/2})_{\mu i}}                                  & \prec \sqrt{\frac{\vphi+\eta}{N\eta}},                                                 \\
