With $\sigma$ and $\tilde b \equiv \tilde\mu$ constant, \eqref{eq:pde-general} is the semilinear equation
\begin{equation}
    \pp_t w \;=\; \frac{\sigma^2}{2}\,\pp^2_{yy} w - \tilde\mu\,\pp_y w + \tilde f(w),
