[Proposition 28 of arXiv:2609.03736, '2609.03736'] For each $\varsigma\in\{-1,+1\}$,
\begin{equation}
 \liminf_{n\to\infty}\frac{A^{\mathrm K}_{\varsigma}(n)}n
 \geq\delta_\pi.

\end{equation}

