[Lemma eq:Kestimate1 of arXiv:2510.24424, 'On the Fourier Coefficients of Critical Gaussian Multiplicative Chaos'] Let $\|k'\|_\infty=\sup_{x\in[-1,1]} |k'(x)|$. Fix $s>0$. Then uniformly in $\Delta\in [-1,1]\setminus\{0\}$,

\begin{align}
    K_{s}(\Delta)=s\land (\log|\Delta|^{-1})+O(\|k'\|_{\infty}).
\end{align}

