[Lemma lem:contractionH of arXiv:2411.18563, 'Lower tails for triangles inside the critical window'] Let $\lambda\ge0, \zeta\in[0,1]$ and let $H$ be a graph with maximum degree $\Delta$. Let
 $P=P_{H,\lambda,\zeta}$.
Then for $y,z\in\Omega_H$ we have
\begin{equation}
\frac{W_1(Py,Pz)}{\mathrm{dist}(y,z)} \leq 1-\frac{1-\Delta \lambda \zeta}{|V(H)|}\, .
\end{equation}

