[Lemma l:cap of arXiv:2510.13659, 'On the energy image density conjecture of Bouleau and Hirsch'] Let $(X,d,\mu, \mathcal{E}_p,\mathcal{F}_p, \Gamma_p)$ be a $p$-Dirichlet space, where $p \in (1,\infty)$. Then  for any sequence of subsets $(A_n)_{n \in \mathbb{N}}$ of $X$, we have 
		\begin{equation} 
			\cCap \left(\bigcup_{n=1}^\infty A_n \right)^{1/p}\le 2^{(p-1)/p} \sum_{n=1}^\infty \cCap(A_n)^{1/p}. 
		\end{equation}

