[Lemma 40 of arXiv:2511.07350, 'Decoupling of clusters in independent sets in a percolated hypercube'] For all $p \in (0,1)$,
\begin{equation}
    \Cov(\Phi_{\log}^\cE, \Phi_{\log}^\cO) \ll \Var(\Phi_{\log}).
\end{equation}

