[Corollary cor:RelaxationTimeModified of arXiv:2511.10630, 'Cutoff for generalised Bernoulli--Laplace urn models'] The relaxation time $t_{\textup{rel}}^+$ of the additive reversibilisation $\mathbf{X}^{\textup{mod},+}$ of $\mathbf{X}^{\textup{mod}}$ satisfies
