$$
P\big(g(X) \geq t\big) \leq P\big(|g(X)| \geq t\big) \leq P\big(g'(X) \geq t\big).
$$
$g'$ satisfies the properties of theorem~\ref{theorem2}. Applying it
\begin{equation}
P(g'(X)\geq t) \leq ns(t), \ \forall t \geq 0.
