with value $+\infty$ if the set is empty.  For
$\varsigma\in\{-1,+1\}$, define
\begin{equation}
 A^{\mathrm K}_{\varsigma}(n)
 =\inf\{r_n(u):0\ne u\in\cE_n^\varsigma,\ u_0=0\},

