[Lemma 17 of arXiv:2608.02927, 'Thinning Operation via the Poisson-F\"ollmer Process'] Let $X$ have density $f$ with respect to $\pi_{T}$ and $T = \E X > 0.$ Then 
    \begin{displaymath}
        \frac{P_{T-s}f(1)}{P_{T-s}f(0)} \le \frac{T}{T-s}
    \end{displaymath}
    for $s < T.$

