body:
[Lemma hdot-rep of arXiv:2608.30212, 'A Painlev\'e equation for the H\"ormander-Bernhardsson constant'] Let $k$ be even and $c\in J_{k,0}$. Then
\begin{align}
\dot{h}_k(c) = \frac{\pi}{2}   Q_{k,c}(0)^2
\end{align}

Since $h_k(0)>0$, we have $h_{k}> 0$ on $J_{k,0}\cap [0,\infty)$.

