        \end{split}
    \end{equation}
    where the outer sum is over all configurations with given characters $ I(E,\vec{q)},\ \tau_{j_{1}},\dots \tau_{j_{m}},\ \eta_{j_{p}}'s:\ j_{p}\in J_{A}$ of $(E,\vec{q})\in \mathcal{I}$.

