[Lem 19 (Optimal scale of a fixed two-point member) of arXiv:2609.02398, '\textbf{Convex Order Comparisons for Sub-Gamma Random Variables}'] For every $p \in (0, 1/2]$ and $\nu > 0$, the infimum
\begin{align*}
    \inf\left\{c > 0 : Y_{p,\nu} \lecx c\,\Lap\right\} = \frac{(1-p)\,\nu}{1 + \log\frac{1}{2p}}
\end{align*}
is attained.

