where $G_D$ denotes the Green function in $D$ with Dirichlet boundary conditions. Here, $G_D$ is normalized so that as $y \to x$, $G_{D}(x,y) \sim -\log(\vert x - y \vert)$. Let $\alpha, \tilde \alpha > 1$ be such that $\frac{1}{\alpha}+\frac{1}{\tilde ...","release_manifest_digest":"sha256:2915bc356f264e0342a609bbb96761e7913a6af76040fef73a1b7e095b41fd4c","revision_digest":"sha256:18d5d33ed6fc71c1476431736a679bb092c7b65c742c6a8bc8dd9e402c08b696","source_id":"arxiv:2411.16452","source_revision":"tex-as-downloaded-2026-09-08","statement_fidelity_reviewed":false,"supersedes":[],"trust_class":"curated_secondary","truth_status":"unverified"}

