[Theorem 19 of arXiv:2606.31455, 'Discrete time-multidimensional renewal theory and applications'] Assume $\mathbbm{E}\!\left[h(X_1)^{\top}h(X_1)\right]<\infty$.
Under \eqref{eq:lambda-scaling},

\begin{equation}
\frac{W_h(k_{1:d})-A_h\,N(k_{1:d})}{\sqrt{|k|_1}}
\xrightarrow[k_{1:d}\stackrel{\lambda}{\to}\infty]{d}
