[Lemma 5 (Coordinate moments) of arXiv:2605.11451, '2605.11451'] Let $X\sim\nu_{p,n}$ and let $r>-1$. Then
\begin{equation}
 \E |X_1|^r
 =\frac{\Gamma(1+n/p)\Gamma((r+1)/p)}
 {\Gamma(1/p)\Gamma(1+(n+r)/p)}.
\end{equation}
In particular,
\begin{equation}
 v_{p,n}:=\E X_1^2
 =\frac{\Gamma(3/p)\Gamma(1+n/p)}
 {\Gamma(1/p)\Gamma(1+(n+2)/p)}.
\end{equation}
Therefore
\[
 \Var \langle X,\theta\rangle=v_{p,n}\lVert\theta\rVert_2^2.
\]

