[Lemma nonregu of arXiv:2411.15881, 'Stable Approximation for Call Function Via Stein's method'] For any $M>2$ and let $f_{g_{M}}$ be the solution to equation (equation stablestein of the paper), then for any $y\in\left(-\infty,\infty\right)$, we have
\begin{align}
\|f''_{g_{M}}(y)\|_{\infty}
\leq\frac{\left(4\alpha+2\alpha^{\frac{2\alpha-2}{\alpha}}-1\right)\eta_{1,\alpha,\delta}}{(\alpha-1)M^{\frac{2(1-\alpha)}{3\alpha-1}}}
:=\frac{\eta_{3,\alpha,\delta}}{M^{\frac{2(\alpha-1)}{3\alpha-1}}}.
\end{align}

