body:
[Lemma lem:equa-norm of arXiv:2606.31155, 'The well-posedness of stochastic Korteweg--de Vries equations revisited'] Let $0\leq b<1/2$. Then
		\begin{equation*}
			c\|u\|_{X^{s,b}_T}\leq\inf\{\|\tilde{u}\|_{X^{s,b}}:\tilde{u}|_{[0,T]\times\mathbb{R}} = u\}\leq C\|u\|_{X^{s,b}_T},
		\end{equation*}
		where $c$ and $C$ depend on $b$ only.

