[Lemma eq:e-bound of arXiv:2607.27613, 'Regularized Bulk Universality versus Bounded-Disorder Nonuniversality\\for Annealed Comple'] \label[lemma]{lem:coefficient-bounds}
For \(O\in\mathcal O_{N,L}\) and every \(I\in[N]^p\),
\begin{align}
 \left\lverte_I(O)\right\rvert&\le N^{-1/2}r_N^p,\\
 \sum_{a=1}^n\abs{b_{a,I}(O)}^2
 &\le C_pr_N^{2p-2},\\
 \left\lVertC_I(O)\right\rVert_{\mathrm{HS}}
 &\le C_p\bigl(N^{-1/2}r_N^{p-2}+r_N^p\bigr),
 &\left\lVertC_I(O)\right\rVert_{\mathrm{op}}
