  \mathbf{E}\Bigg[  \bigg|\int_0^{t+\delta}   W'_\beta(t+\delta-s) X_\zeta(s)ds - \int_0^t 	  W'_\beta(t-s) X_\zeta(s)ds \bigg|^{2p} \Bigg] \leq C\cdot \delta^p \cdot  (\zeta \vee \zeta^{2p})\cdot (1+t+\delta)^{3p}  
