[Lemma lem-5.6 of arXiv:2505.24043, 'Weak solutions of Navier-Stokes Equation with purely discontinuous L\'evy Noise'] Let $ \psi \inU$ and $n\in \mathbb{N}$ be fixed. Then, the map
