[Lemma lem:CompareMeanFieldToRestricted of arXiv:2511.10630, 'Cutoff for generalised Bernoulli--Laplace urn models'] For all functions $f \colon \mathrm{Centre}(C) \to \mathbb{R}$ and $n \geqslant n_0(C, d, m)$, we have
    \begin{equation*}
    \langle(I-P^{\textup{res}}) f, f\rangle_{\pi_{\textup{res}}} \leqslant M \langle (I-P^{\textup{ind},+})f, f\rangle_{\pi_{\textup{ind}}} ,
    \end{equation*}
    where
    \begin{equation*}
        M = \frac{2^{d+3} m^{4d^2+d} d^{4d^2+3}}{\Phi_{\ast}} ,
    \end{equation*}
    and $P^{\textup{res}}$ and $P^{\textup{ind},+}$ are the transition matrices of the mean-field chain $Y^{\textup{res}}$, restricted to $\mathrm{Centre}(C)$, and the additive reversibilisation of the generalised Bernoulli--Laplace chain induced on $\mathrm{Centre}(C)$, respectively.

