[Lemma lem:vd-l2-separated-side-collars of arXiv:2609.00698, 'Kinetic Wedge Layers and Diffusive Limit of Neutron Transport in Polygonal Domains'] The constants $c_{\mathrm{fs}},\ell_{\mathrm{nor}}>0$ can be chosen, depending only on $\Omega$, so that for every side $E_j$ the one-sided collar
\begin{align}
 \mathsf C_j^{\rm col}
 &:={}
 \left\{
 \mathsf X_j(s,d):
 0<s<L_j,\quad
 0<d<2\ell_{\mathrm{nor}},\quad
 d<2c_{\mathrm{fs}} s,\quad
