[Lem 57 of arXiv:2605.23308, 'Convergence rate estimates for semigroups and heat kernels associated with resistance form'] For any bounded measurable function $f:M\to\R,\;t>0$ and $x\in F_n$, define $\varphi:[0,t]\to\R$ by setting
\begin{align*}
 \varphi(s)=P^n_{t-s}G^{\alpha,n}J_n^rP_sG^{\alpha}f(x),\quad s\in [0,t]. 
