body:
[Lemma 17 of arXiv:2607.07022, 'Coordinate-wise Elephant Random Walk'] For every $T>0,$ the jump size $\Delta \calM^{(f,n)} (t)$ of the c\`adl\`ag martingale satisfies  
\begin{equation*}
    J(\calM^{(f,n)}, T):=\sup_{0<t\le T}|\Delta\calM^{(f,n)}(t)| \leq \frac{4\|f\|_\infty}{\sqrt n} \xrightarrow[n\to \infty]{}0.
\end{equation*}
In particular, $\lim_{n\to \infty} \E\left[J( \mathcal M^{(f,n)},T)^2\right]= 0$.

