[Lemma Lem:equiv Gamma and Gamma-lambda of arXiv:2411.03512, 'Ergodicity and Mixing of Sublinear Expectation System and Applications'] Suppose that $\Gamma\subset \mathbb{R}^d$ is a non-empty bounded closed convex subset. Then $\Gamma$ is uniquely determinated by $\{\Gamma^{\lambda}\}_{\lambda\in \mathbb Q^d_1}$, i.e.,
     \begin{equation*}
         x\in \Gamma \text{ if and only if } x^{\lambda}\in \Gamma^{\lambda} \text{ for all } \lambda\in \mathbb Q^d_1.
     \end{equation*}

