body:
[Lemma 47 of arXiv:2607.07283, 'Multi-time Markov renewal chains and stratified renewal theorems'] For every compact set $K\subset\R^d$,

\begin{equation}
\sup_{k\in\mathcal W_a(K)}
\left|
 a^{(d-1)/2}U_C(k)-\one_{\{k\in\mathcal L_*\}}
\phi^{\perp,*}_{m,\Gamma}\left(\frac{k-am}{\sqrt a}\right)
\right|
\xrightarrow[a\to\infty]{}0.
\end{equation}

