 \begin{align*}
     |\mathbb E[U_sX]-\mathbb E[U_tX]|\le \hat{\mathbb E}[|U_sX-U_tX|]=\hat{\mathbb E}[|X-U_{t-s}X|],
 \end{align*}
 which together with the continuity of the system, implies the continuity of the map $s\mapsto \mathbb E[U_sX]$. 

	Given any $X\in\mathcal{H}$, let
