[Prop 103 of arXiv:2507.08909, 'Annealed almost periodic entropy'] Fix $x \in X$ and let $F$ be a grounded subset of $\G$.  Let $\pi$ be a random action in which the generators $\pi(s)$, $s \in S$, are independent and distributed according to $m$. Then a regular conditional distribution for $(\pi(s):\ s \in S)$ given the orbit patch $\pi^{(x)}|F$ is given by
\begin{equation}
m_F(\,\cdot \mid \bf{y}) := \prod_{s \in S} m(\,\cdot\,|\,\bf{y}_{F\cap s^{-1}F};\bf{y}_{s F\cap F}) \qquad (\bf{y} \in Y_{F,x}).
\end{equation}

