[Definition 48 of arXiv:2603.28734, 'Free energy analyticity of the disordered XY model and Debye screening in the 2D Coulomb g'] Fix a subgraph $G$ of $\Z^d$, a configuration $\tau \in \Pi_G$, and $-\infty \leq -t < -s \leq 0$. 
