$$
	\frac{1}{k!} 
	\|(\tfrac{1}{g_q}-s)^{(k)}\|_{[-\frac{1}{8q},\frac{1}{8q}]}
        \le 2^{-bq} (8q)^k
$$
for all $k\ge 0$. In particular, 
$\frac{1}{2}\frac{1}{g_q(x)} \le s(x) \le \frac{3}{2}\frac{1}{g_q(x)}$
for all $|x|\le \frac{1}{8q}$.

