[Lemma 10 of arXiv:2607.13308, 'No infinite clusters at criticality for two-dimensional dependent percolation under abstra'] Assume~\eqref{h2},~\eqref{h3},~\eqref{h4}, and $\theta(\lambda)>0$. There exist $\uc{c:circ}>0$ and $\alpha>0$ such that, for any $m \leq n$,
