[Lemma of arXiv:2602.19773, 'Regularization of a stationary point process by a stationary increments perturbation'] Let $\xi$ be an ergodic point process with intensity $\lambda_{\xi}$, then 
		\begin{equation*}
			\lim_{r\to +\infty}\frac{\xi(\mathsf{B}_{r})}{\Vol{\mathsf{B}_{r}}}  = \lim_{r\to +\infty}\frac{\hat{\xi}(\mathsf{B}_{r})}{\Vol{\mathsf{B}_{r}}} = \lambda_{\xi} \quad a.s.
		\end{equation*}

